<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says millennium costs material.</title>
<headline>Telecom says millennium costs material.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said in a prospectus published on Thursday that millennium costs would be material, and the company was considering whether to include provision for these in the 1997 financial statements.</p>
</text>
